##########################################################################################
SFCC-801 global/country-currency-selector — PWA Component
--- DESCRIPTION ---
As a Developer, 


I want a reusable 
global/country-currency-selector
 React component built to the Zimmermann Design System 2026 spec, 


so that it can be consumed across storefronts to allow shoppers to select their shipping country, currency, and optionally language.
The component is a right-anchored slide-in drawer. It accepts props to control which optional sections render. It does not own redirect logic — that will be covered in 
https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-688
 or 
https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-817

